# SEIS Obsidian Rule
- Use plain Markdown only.
- Do not require Obsidian plugins to consume core notes.
- Use `[[internal links]]` where dependencies matter.
- Keep naming stable for backlink reliability.
- Store only public-safe content unless explicitly outside repository scope.
- Do not commit local/private vault content such as real credentials or personal notes.
- Keep note metadata synchronized with `SEIS_OBSIDIAN_VAULT.md` and `seis-brain/README.md`.
